<title>UK: Bayerische Hypo sets 10 bln Greek drachma FRN. [CORRECTED 13:20 GMT]</title>
<headline>Bayerische Hypo sets 10 bln Greek drachma FRN. [CORRECTED 13:20 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue</p>
<p>was announced by joint lead manager Morgan Stanley International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE HYPOTHEKEN- UND WECHSEL-BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN GRD    BASE    * 3M-ATHIBOR MATURITY    10.SEP.99</p>
<p>(CORRECTS MATURITY DATE FROM 31.AUG.99)</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     -0.75 PCT PAY DATE    10.SEP.97</p>
<p>(CORRECTS PAY DATE FROM 02.SEP.97)</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AA2	 ISS PRICE  100.90    FULL FEES   1.00 PCT</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    100</p>
<p> NOTES    * COUPON ON 10.MAR.98 IS 10.625 PCT</p>
<p>(CORRECTS COUPON DATE FROM 27.FEB.98)</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (M) 1-5	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/GR/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.90	SELL CONC  0.10	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	NOT 144A</p>
<p>		BANK OF GREECE IS THE OTHER JOINT LEAD MANAGER</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
